{
  "slug": "masa",
  "name": "Masa",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Teach your AI coding agent the MASA (Modular Agentic Semantic Architecture) framework — maximizes how well agents can understand, navigate, and safely modify your codebase.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **6 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `masa-framework` (Apply the MASA (Modular Agentic Semantic Architecture) framework when writing, reviewing, or refactoring code)\n- **Commands** (6): `audit` (Full audit of an entire MASA layer for imports, naming, and compliance), `explain` (Explain a specific MASA ruleset with language-specific examples), `new-feature` (Walk through the MASA 5-step protocol to implement a new feature), `refactor` (Propose a MASA-compliant refactoring of the current code), `scaffold` (Generate the full MASA directory skeleton for a language), `validate` (Audit the current file or selection for MASA architectural compliance)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install masa@claude-community` from `nicolasfmelo/masa-skill`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "command": 6
  },
